      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sajita Duweacheeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Agwalnean duweachajeega sean, was jeata madeeda aba bugusta fuga Israeli ghang'eada dea siida ea ghoah gea dugwa. Suh geasu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ghweelmeeda mukaateeyda meamwatawiida",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Musa ak gwayeesha buuneeda, “Oapkaada eaweeda ghayi ooriteawi aba ng'eanyiida Misri aba gheeda soomjeandumeeda, gooruunaneegwa NG'UTAMIIDA hoowa aba uurdaanyi haw, ak ea adoayaaji mukaateeyda simwatawiit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agooga gooriti nea geeng'usha sheeda, bea damanda heasa boogean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyas gweaneegwa NG'UTAMIIDA ea ghoahiineegwa ng'eanyiida fuga Ganaani, ea fuga Hiti, ea Amori, ea fuga Hafiti, ea Yebusi, ghayi heeleesa sea ghweanigeagwa gideaba gaygagoneegwa, ng'eanyiida nyiit eanooga ea maleeda, asi gilakweay gagasa oopkeata sheeni ghayi ooriniin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gajayaaga mukaateeyda meamwatawiida eawooji ispwa, ak eaweedeaba ispwa gajea ghweelmeeda NG'UTAMIIDA gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukaateeyda meamwatawiida gajeayaak eawoojisu asispwaan, ak mukaateeyda simwatawiit, adeedeaksa headaang'u, eara gidamwataw adeedeaksa headaang'u, ghana heeda wassean aba jeeda ng'eanyiidaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayrukusiina dibiigagu eaweedida, gideaba ‘Geesinyi ghweelmeeda uurji nih aba ng'asheanda nisinnean NG'UTAMIIDA damanda earini aba ng'eanyiida Misri.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayghoah gwadeagooda aba geatindaang'u, nea ghoah giipkeata aba gheanyangaagu, nea gwanda ghuutaang'u deaweedeeda NG'UTAMIIDA aba gideaba gooruunaneey NG'UTAMIIDA ng'eanyiida Misri aba geatinda mideawa uurda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa gajeang'waanya diigheanji galeagasean ea ghoah gilakweay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Duweacheeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inyas gweaneey NG'UTAMIIDA ea ghoahiineey ng'eanyiida fuga Ganaani, gawuurji gidaghayi bean gwarukuteayda nea gwarukusa eara ghweanigeagwa gideaba gaygagoonyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda duweachajeega sean gaygaba NG'UTAMIIDA. Ak eara aba jeeda dugwaagu gisiji aba mwadi was heeyda gaygaba NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gilinyoo ea jurukuta jeata madeeda bea digeeda gajatinana dayeenda gisilleanda, ghana iimigassi atina, gayhirja gheata. Ak duweacheeda siida aba jeeda orjoagaagu gajatina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak inyas ghwahidu damanda ak ghoanyaashnyi orjeedang'u gideaba, ‘Gili gideabeadaanyi naaha?’ Gajeeshiina niny, ‘nih geebaysiina gideaba gooruuneasa NG'UTAMIIDA aba geatinda uurdaanyi aba gheeda soomjeandumeeda aba ng'eanyiida Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damandideani heaweewa Farao gwasikseasa eeweayeena ak ghabwar NG'UTAMIIDA duweachajeega sean bea ng'eanyiida Misri, duweacheeda siida ea dea dugwa. Ak ghoah gideabaysiini daadaw NG'UTAMIIDA duweachajeega sean bea heewga sighus duweachajeega sean bea orjoogeasu gaydeatin.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ng'asheanji gayghoah gwadeagooda aba geatindaang'u, ak giyiini dageascheeda gheanyangaagu, NG'UTAMIIDA gooruunaneasa ng'eanyiida Misri aba uurdaanyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daraneeda shamooghooda ea daraneeda beasta",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea gwasiksa Farao buuneeda gaweay ea moadoabiiwa ASEETA ghwanung' gwasik ng'eanyiida fuga Filisti, earapeadi naweeda lach ng'eanyi, aba gideaba gwayi ASEETA, “Gajiidu ghwayam geat buuneeda ak gabiikta Misri iidaah ng'ucheeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goosiik ASEETA buuneeda naweeda dareapcheeda, neekeewa basooda Shaamu. Ak gwascheeng'na fuga Israeli ng'eanyiida Misri nea nishaash dabita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwasar Musa geaka Yosefu, aba gideaba ghayi Yosefu niyeaksa fuga Israeli habeawooda nea gwayeesha, “Gaygabareaseegwa ASEETA ak ghoasareanyi geakeasu oang'aamwana hiji.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geang'eatng'eat eeweay nea geang'eada Sukoti, ak geewus aba Etamu, mida moonghooda dareapcheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyeesa askweari goosheedeawa NG'UTAMIIDA saawa aba jeeda shamooghooda uurji daraneeda, aba gideaba ghoadoabiiw naweeda nyaawa, nea eawa ghoadoabiiw daraneeda beasta aba gideaba ghoabwaay naweeda nyaawa aba gideaba gaweay askweari ea eawa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "daraneedida bea shamooghooda bea askweariin, ea daraneedida bea beasta bea eawean, mii goosiipteawa madeeda buuneeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
